IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mlr-core`
IMPORT `mlr5-sch5`

-- TESTS for Schedule 5 (Connected Persons).  Expected values are written from the text of lines 3242-3255
-- (para 1: a body corporate's officer, manager, employee, agent, and the officer, manager or agent of a
-- parent undertaking; para 2: a partnership's member, manager, employee, agent; para 3: an unincorporated
-- association's member, officer, manager, employee, agent; para 4: an individual's employee or agent).
-- Every expected value is decided from the text before the run.

§ `Schedule 5 -- fixtures`

--                                         officer manager offParent manParent employee agent agentPar member
`sch 5 test: no role`       MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: officer`       MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: manager`       MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: parent officer` MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: parent manager` MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: employee`      MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: agent`         MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`sch 5 test: parent agent`  MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`sch 5 test: member`        MEANS `sch 5 roles of the person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE

§ `Schedule 5 para 1 -- a body corporate (lines 3243-3249)`

-- (a) an officer or manager of the body corporate: a company; yes for each limb.
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: manager` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) an officer or manager of a parent undertaking of the body corporate
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: parent officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: parent manager` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) an employee of the body corporate; (d) an agent of the body corporate; (e) an agent of a parent undertaking
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: employee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: parent agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A limited liability partnership and a body corporate of another kind are bodies corporate (core, reg 3(1)).
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a body corporate of another kind` `sch 5 test: employee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A member is not one of the five limbs; the paragraph does not say that a member is not connected: NOT COVERED.
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a company` `sch 5 test: no role` EQUALS NOTHING
-- The "If ... is a body corporate" does not hold of an individual, a corporation sole or a partnership.
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `an individual` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a corporation sole` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 1 the person is a connected person of the body corporate` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Schedule 5 para 2 -- a partnership (lines 3250-3251)`

#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: manager` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: employee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "officer" is not listed in paragraph 2, and neither are the roles at a parent undertaking.
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: parent agent` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: no role` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not a partnership: a company, and (fork S5-F1) a limited liability partnership, which is a body corporate.
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a company` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 2 the person is a connected person of the partnership` `a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Schedule 5 para 3 -- an unincorporated association (lines 3252-3253)`

#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: manager` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: employee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: parent officer` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: no role` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 3 the person is a connected person of the unincorporated association` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Schedule 5 para 4 -- an individual (lines 3254-3255)`

#ASSERT `sch 5 para 4 the person is a connected person of the individual` `an individual` `sch 5 test: employee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 4 the person is a connected person of the individual` `an individual` `sch 5 test: agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an officer, manager or member of an individual is not one of the two limbs
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 4 the person is a connected person of the individual` `an individual` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 4 the person is a connected person of the individual` `an individual` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 4 the person is a connected person of the individual` `an individual` `sch 5 test: no role` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 4 the person is a connected person of the individual` `a company` `sch 5 test: employee` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Schedule 5 -- the four paragraphs gathered (SEAM S-16)`

#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `a company` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `an unincorporated association` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `an individual` `sch 5 test: agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the form's paragraph applies and the person has none of its roles: regulation 65(3) hands the definition to the Schedule's list, so the person is not listed (ruling of 2026-11-05); the paragraph's own function above says NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `a company` `sch 5 test: member` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `a company` `sch 5 test: no role` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `an individual` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no paragraph's "If the relevant person ... is ..." holds of a corporation sole or a trust (Marginal readings, (a))
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `a corporation sole` `sch 5 test: officer` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 5 the person is a connected person of the relevant person` `a trust` `sch 5 test: agent` EQUALS JUST FALSE
